    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Diabetes is a common disorder that is growing at an epidemic rate. Worldwide diabetes is seen in 7-8 % of the population. In Pakistan one out of every ten people have this disease and this number is expected to double over the next 25 years,\" informed Dr. Lubna Zuberi, Assistant Professor and Consultant Endocrinologist, Department of Medicine at Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH), while addressing a public health awareness programme held in Hyderabad.",
